caption: Profile picker, New, Edit
tags: $:/plugins/crosseye/json-convert-studio/usage/console
title: $:/plugins/crosseye/json-convert-studio/usage/console/profile-picker
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Every tiddler tagged `$:/tags/json-convert/profile` is a profile and appears
in the dropdown.  Two buttons sit beside it:

* ''New…'' — prompts for a title and, optionally, a profile's JSON to paste in; creates the profile tagged for the profile list and opens it in the editor.  Left empty, the editor greets a new profile with what to fill in first.
* ''Edit'' — opens the currently-selected profile in the editor.  Visible only when a profile is selected.
